    "name": "The Hidden Scrolls",
    "steam_appid": 3201830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cc69ff81d346df2ee2e6538a932157c1.poster.avif?t=1742195967\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cc69ff81d346df2ee2e6538a932157c1.webm?t=1742195967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cc69ff81d346df2ee2e6538a932157c1.mp4?t=1742195967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Mysterious Ancient Fantasy World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of ancient Chinese fantasy, brought to life with an ink-painting style and oil-painting textures. Five mysterious regions are home to ferocious beasts and ruthless bandits. Seek out the scattered bamboo scrolls and uncover the secrets hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/b32027b2298dffddec9dd75df71ca30b.poster.avif?t=1742195967\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/b32027b2298dffddec9dd75df71ca30b.webm?t=1742195967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/b32027b2298dffddec9dd75df71ca30b.mp4?t=1742195967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 12 unique character classes to build your team and use terrain and skills to defeat your enemies. Battle over 60 fierce creatures and bandits, and challenge more than 10 powerful bosses, each with unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/f3d3386f68b31ab0af5131a4ac482a3c.poster.avif?t=1742195967\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/f3d3386f68b31ab0af5131a4ac482a3c.webm?t=1742195967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/f3d3386f68b31ab0af5131a4ac482a3c.mp4?t=1742195967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage a Town and Decipher the Hidden Scrolls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand your town with a variety of structures, recruit and train warriors, invest in shops, and perform sacred rituals with the collected scrolls to uncover deeper hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cc69ff81d346df2ee2e6538a932157c1.poster.avif?t=1742195967\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cc69ff81d346df2ee2e6538a932157c1.webm?t=1742195967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cc69ff81d346df2ee2e6538a932157c1.mp4?t=1742195967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Mysterious Ancient Fantasy World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of ancient Chinese fantasy, brought to life with an ink-painting style and oil-painting textures. Five mysterious regions are home to ferocious beasts and ruthless bandits. Seek out the scattered bamboo scrolls and uncover the secrets hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/b32027b2298dffddec9dd75df71ca30b.poster.avif?t=1742195967\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/b32027b2298dffddec9dd75df71ca30b.webm?t=1742195967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/b32027b2298dffddec9dd75df71ca30b.mp4?t=1742195967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 12 unique character classes to build your team and use terrain and skills to defeat your enemies. Battle over 60 fierce creatures and bandits, and challenge more than 10 powerful bosses, each with unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/f3d3386f68b31ab0af5131a4ac482a3c.poster.avif?t=1742195967\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/f3d3386f68b31ab0af5131a4ac482a3c.webm?t=1742195967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/f3d3386f68b31ab0af5131a4ac482a3c.mp4?t=1742195967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage a Town and Decipher the Hidden Scrolls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand your town with a variety of structures, recruit and train warriors, invest in shops, and perform sacred rituals with the collected scrolls to uncover deeper hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The Hidden Scrolls is a turn-based roguelike tactical RPG with a Chinese-inspired setting. Explore five mysterious regions, battle fierce beasts and ruthless bandits, recruit and train a team of warriors to uncover the secrets hidden within ancient bamboo scrolls.",
